% References for ipcc-verifier-guide.
%
% IPCC chapters are cited by chapter, key ipcc<edition>ch<number>. Each chapter entry carries the
% coordinating lead and lead authors printed on the chapter's title page, contributing authors
% excluded, read from the PDFs listed in 01.manuscript/A1-sources.qmd on 2026-09-17. The entries
% for the 2019 Chapters 2, 4, 6 and 7 were copied from ipcc-carbon-gains and checked against the
% same PDFs. The 2019 Chapter 9 has no entry because it is one page reading "No refinement" and
% names no authors; cite ipcc2019refinement for it.
%
% The 2019 Chapter 3 prints "Endo Takahiro (Japan)" in a list otherwise given name first; the
% entry takes Endo as the family name. The 2019 Chapter 5 prints "Ayaka W. Mo Kishimoto" and
% "Rodel Diaz Lasco"; the entries follow the forms used by the Wetlands Supplement and the 2006
% Guidelines, Kishimoto-Mo and Lasco. The 2006 Chapter 9 prints "Hector D. Ginzo" and Chapter 8
% "Hector Daniel Ginzo"; both entries use the full form, because two forms of one name make the
% citation style print the given names in full to tell them apart.
%
% Journal papers are added only from a CrossRef response, never from memory.

